# Route: guide 2 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 14 to
# 16, 48 quests, 2.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Mulgore, Thunder Bluff): Bloodhoof Village -> Winterhoof Water Well ->
# The Rolling Plains -> The Venture Co. Mine -> Ravaged Caravan -> Thunderhorn
# Water Well -> Bloodhoof Village -> Winterhoof Water Well -> Red Cloud Mesa
# -> Brambleblade Ravine -> Red Cloud Mesa -> Brambleblade Ravine -> Red Cloud
# Mesa -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Ceasing Operations (98427; Venture
# Co. Clearclutter 12).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 768 Gathering
# Leather; 769 Kodo Hide Bag; 97927 Camping 101: Alchemy; 97928 Camping 101:
# Blacksmithing; 97929 Camping 101: Enchanting; 97930 Camping 101:
# Engineering; 97931 Camping 101: First Aid; 97932 Camping 101: Fishing; 97933
# Camping 101: Herbalism; 97934 Camping 101: Leatherworking; 97935 Camping
# 101: Mining; 97936 Camping 101: Skinning; 97937 Camping 101: Tailoring.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102),
# Searching for the Lost Satchel (5722), Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723),
# Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing an Enemy's
# Strength (5723).

